<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-11T15:29:16.775Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:29:16 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Gunmen have again struck civilian targets in Plateau, killing three miners at an illegal mining site and injuring several others, while separate gunmen kidnapped five people and shot two in a community. Berom militiamen attacked a Fulani settlement in Plateau, but troops rescued a gunshot victim. Nigerian forces killed two ISWAP terrorists in Adamawa and recovered weapons. A video shows Ndume being assaulted by youths in Borno, and bandit leader Kachalla Bello was reported killed in Katsina. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQMGJ0XzNpMHFGZE92em51c0syWmxld09tWGM0M1BNMThvMkxwSE1leGduMVF2eExmUzlRSXZBRmpCM0lYQVdVVERGZ2JPT2dQeUdhZXJkVXd3T1NhdTlrQ2hmZ0VDeGJBT1hENlhrTGVCSWxKSUJQaU85bzE1Y1RXUkhJMnRiYkxSR0NTODh6UHoyMEdmNU50VHJMUjdMamJwR05ZLV9iT2Jmd2VPVncyZkEzLVI?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOb2xYNnBaTFZmOEc1UFZvR0tnV2RHUnJ2WGNCZ3VqU2VBMzNOaEktZjhUcF9XNlNaNDIydk9ZbU5zQnJhSGdhQ05ib1dHME50Qm9HeGhTWHJHYXpacm45QlZMaE5XVmF1LUJld3NIWnJwOEhKclNrOENTQTN0TDBXLWFrSzQ0RXM1cVhiWnprQ1hzNHVCLWhxN05OaG5vRW14ODhYVTZ4MDlVOWM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE1uVWQyRWhnUncyWUhtT3VZTmFDU29ra3ZtZDB6NHdKeU9KbjNtdHM1WE5DTEZfbHROZEtvODA0TExtVlA4MTI1dmNLRUVtMWMzcnBid1F1VDh5LTlxalZUQzVBVHVxVXk2SVd5cg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Sun Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxNWDZrdjN2T0stdFNKbXFYMF84ZTNMSXhCeDNVZldFUVBqY2UxMHpwbEQyRWdvUTZNX0hUSkYwZ1B3cGdCNGNyRmozTmppQXpzUE93RkJKLWVZQ0ZJbm5VU253a19xVFJtNFBTU2l0WTh2VnlRZlZjWGl0elEtSHR0THZQOXNGUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;News Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxOU1Flbk1aeXd